{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-2a19546cdca8","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-2a19546cdca8","name":"西红柿豆腐汤羹","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E8%B1%86%E8%85%90%E6%B1%A4%E7%BE%B9/%E8%A5%BF%E7%BA%A2%E6%9F%BF%E8%B1%86%E8%85%90%E6%B1%A4%E7%BE%B9.md","blob_sha":"102344245c7f401f5bfe09ee33e8245cbf34690c","details":{"introduction":"一道清淡鲜美的家常汤羹，酸甜开胃，口感嫩滑。西红柿富含维生素 C 和番茄红素，搭配鸡蛋与豆腐，能补充优质蛋白，营养均衡易吸收。做法简单，只需切配翻炒和煮制，新手也能轻松掌握，从准备到出锅大约 15 分钟即可完成。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"* 西红柿\n* 鸡蛋\n* 豆腐\n* 食用油\n* 盐\n* 淀粉\n* 鸡精\n* 香葱\n* 姜\n* 开水"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n* 西红柿 1 个\n* 鸡蛋 1 个\n* 豆腐 100 g\n* 食用油 5 ml\n* 盐 2 g\n* 淀粉 5 g\n* 鸡精 2 g\n* 香葱 0.5 根\n* 姜 1 片\n* 开水 350 ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 西红柿切成小丁、鸡蛋打入碗中搅拌、豆腐切块备用\n2. 起锅烧油，放入姜片 5 S 后倒入入西红柿翻炒 30 S\n3. 锅中加入开水，汤水烧开，60 S 后到入鸡蛋液、豆腐块\n4. 汤水重新烧开后，加入水淀粉，沿一个方向搅拌 2 圈\n5. 加入鸡精、盐、香葱，30 S 后起锅"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：红熟番茄250g、净全鸡蛋液100g、软豆腐200g、大豆食用油8g、食盐3g、玉米淀粉8g、小葱8g、姜4g、饮用水450g；整份约900g。软豆腐版本，省略鸡精的标准变体，汤和食材全部食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":46.328889,"protein_g":3.264444,"carbohydrate_g":2.378689,"fat_g":2.826578},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/170457/nutrients","version":"80b7f4f8ef0034f2","fdc_ids":[170457,171287,172449,171411,173468,169698,170005,169231,173647]},"profile_id":"family-2a19546cdca8-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-2a19546cdca8","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-2a19546cdca8","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":f